    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aggressus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adg-</span></b> ), ūs, m.
		aggredior. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An attack</i>, <i>assault</i> (cf.
			aggredior, II. B.), <i><span class="en">Dig. 36, 1,
			17</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An entering upon</i>, <i>beginning;</i> opp. exitus (cf. aggredior, II. C.), Firm. Math. 2,
			10.</div>
